WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,560
Listen to what Mr. Lu of the Ministry of Justice said

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:05,750
You have rarely been responsible for the ministry recently.

3
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:08,940
The idle and empty duties of the Ministry of Establishment

4
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,940
It doesn't matter whether I go or not

5
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,940
You're just spending your days idle now

6
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:13,940
Seemingly at ease

7
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,940
In fact, it is the foundation for the future

8
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,940
If a person does not have real power, he will not have the confidence to stand on the ground.

9
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,980
Always plan for the future

10
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:20,980
Waiting for mother to come back

11
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:23,980
If you let her know that you are wasting your time all day

12
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:29,130
Then brother, you might as well put me in the public department. Go to the public department.

13
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:31,380
Isn’t there a vacant position in the public ministry right now?

14
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:34,380
Weren't you in the public ministry before you were injured due to false duties?

15
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:36,540
It's inconvenient for her to go now

16
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:38,540
That position can't always be empty.

17
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,540
I'll go to the top

18
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:41,540
I came here to do my job in vain.

19
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:43,540
Secondly, it can be considered as finding a place for yourself.

20
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:44,540
Save yourself from idleness every day

21
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,540
Let brother catch it

22
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:50,060
We still have to discuss this matter with Xu Zhi

23
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,220
If she agrees

24
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:52,220
Let her say it

25
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:53,220
will be better
